cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below. There is no
  accompanying paper yet: the manuscript is unsubmitted, so the software is the
  citable artefact.
type: software
title: celltype-audit
abstract: >-
  Tests single-cell atlas cell-type labels against expression evidence and the Cell
  Ontology, rather than against other labels. A cluster's markers are scored over a
  shared discriminative subspace against a CELLxGENE expression reference, and a
  disagreement between the asserted term's lineage and the evidence's is reported as
  a ranked review queue rather than as a classification. Its by-products are candidate
  Cell Ontology contributions, each published with the verification checks that ran
  and, explicitly, those that did not.
authors:
  - family-names: Meena
    given-names: Narendra
version: 0.1.9
date-released: "2026-08-26"
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/narendrameena/celltype-audit
url: https://narendrameena.github.io/celltype-audit/
keywords:
  - single-cell transcriptomics
  - Cell Ontology
  - cell type annotation
  - quality control
  - data curation
  - CELLxGENE
